# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the value.
# .env.local is gitignored — never commit a real key.
#
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
#
# For the deployed site, add the same variable in Vercel:
#   Project → Settings → Environment Variables → ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#
# Without this set, the "Ask about my work" box degrades gracefully:
# it tells visitors to email instead. Nothing else on the site breaks.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
